<title>UK: Salomon Brothers set warrants on Swiss Re.</title>
<headline>Salomon Brothers set warrants on Swiss Re.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers International has issued a total of five million American-style call warrants, on Swiss Re, lead manager Salomon Brothers Finanz AG said.</p>
<p>50 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1350.00 SFR	     PREMIUM	11.28 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.60 SFR		  GEARING	10.2 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 24.SEP.96-16.JAN.98   PAYDATE	23.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS STOCK EXCHANGE  MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1330 SFR</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
